                {
                    "id": "60067601",
                    "speaker": "Aamu",
                    "text": "This won't do... If I don't make up my mind soon, my food's going to get cold...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "60067602",
                            "text": "What's the problem?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "60067603",
                                    "speaker": "Aamu",
                                    "text": "*sigh* I'm trying to decide whether I should take this boxed lunch to Zhuoxin. He's always working so hard at the harbor, I have no idea if he's even eating properly..."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "60067604",
